    // **The first `implementations` entries in the graph.** `LayerMethod.implementations`
    // has existed since session 113 and nothing had ever filled it, so the
    // section said "none recorded" on all 63 methods and a reader could not tell
    // an unwritten record from a method nobody has implemented. Each entry below
    // is one distinct construction the cited paper describes, with the paper as
