        "    for 1/x       :  f(x) = (1 - (1 - x^2)^b) / x   with  b = ceil(k^2 log(k/e))",
        "                     # odd, and accurate only on [-1,1] minus (-1/k, 1/k) --",
        "                     # a gap of width 1/k around the origin, which is where",
